        "text": "已按您的意见改为更谨慎的表述（修订处已用修订模式标出，请审阅）：\n\n原句：Our retrospective study indicated that adding RT to chemoimmunotherapy could significantly improve the survival of patients with recurrent/metastatic esophageal cancer.\n改为：Our retrospective study suggests that adding RT to chemoimmunotherapy may be associated with improved survival in patients with recurrent/metastatic esophageal cancer, although this finding is exploratory and requires confirmation in prospective randomized trials.\n\n具体改动有三处：\n1. indicated → suggests（\"表明\"降为\"提示\"）；\n2. could significantly improve the survival → may be associated with improved survival（去掉因果/显著性的强断言，改为\"可能相关\"，与回顾性队列研究的设计相符；统计显著性已在 Results 中用 HR 和 P 值给出，此处不再重复\"significantly\"）；\n3. 末句补充限制性说明 \"although this finding is exploratory and requires confirmation in prospective randomized trials\"（本研究为探索性、需前瞻性随机试验验证）。\n\n另：紧随其后的\"In addition, the combination of ICIs and RT was found to be safe and tolerable.\"一句不在批注范围内，未作改动；如需同样弱化为 \"appeared to be safe and tolerable\"，请告知，我可一并处理。摘要 Conclusions 中\"Adding RT can significantly improve survival\"亦为同类强表述，本次未在批注范围内改动。"
